{"id":"f7ee6b96f80ad0a8","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Syntactic Category","display":"df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category — ZFC Logic9 Syntactic Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category — ZFC Logic9 Syntactic Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category — ZFC Logic9 Syntactic Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P\\in V\">\\(C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> is the set-coded category predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\sigma)\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\sigma)\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span>, and the category-component projections are defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S\\)</span> is the four-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}context\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}context\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}provable\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash \\varphi\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar v_{&lt;n}\\,(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}provable\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash \\varphi\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar v_{&lt;n}\\,(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}identity\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}(\\bar x,\\bar x&#39;)\\coloneqq\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\bar x=\\bar x&#39;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}identity\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}(\\bar x,\\bar x&#39;)\\coloneqq\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\bar x=\\bar x&#39;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}composition\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)(\\bar x,\\bar z)\\coloneqq\\exists\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\eta(\\bar y,\\bar z))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}composition\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)(\\bar x,\\bar z)\\coloneqq\\exists\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\eta(\\bar y,\\bar z))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}category\\text{-}projections}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Obj}(\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle)=O\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}(A,B)=\\{f\\in M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{id}^{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}_A=e(A)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to g\\circ_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}f=c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}category\\text{-}projections}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Obj}(\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle)=O\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}(A,B)=\\{f\\in M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{id}^{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}_A=e(A)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to g\\circ_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}f=c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S(C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Obj}(C)=\\{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:n\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad=\\left\\{[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\psi(\\bar y))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\,(\\varphi(\\bar x)\\to\\exists\\bar y\\,\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y))\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\forall\\bar y&#39;\\,((\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y&#39;))\\to\\bar y=\\bar y&#39;)\\right\\}\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{id}^{C}_{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}}=[\\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m,k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{m+k}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl([\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(k,\\chi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\circ_C[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}=[\\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S(C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Obj}(C)=\\{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:n\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad=\\left\\{[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\psi(\\bar y))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\,(\\varphi(\\bar x)\\to\\exists\\bar y\\,\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y))\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\forall\\bar y&#39;\\,((\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y&#39;))\\to\\bar y=\\bar y&#39;)\\right\\}\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{id}^{C}_{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}}=[\\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m,k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{m+k}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl([\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(k,\\chi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\circ_C[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}=[\\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Objects are provable-equivalence classes of formulas in context; arrows are provably total single-valued relations compatible with source and target.</li>\n<li>The proof calculus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> is explicit, so changing the derivability relation changes the syntactic category rather than silently changing the truth of a three-place predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ is the set-coded category predicate from [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\sigma)$ as in [[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}context\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<n\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}provable\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash \\varphi\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar v_{<n}\\,(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}identity\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}(\\bar x,\\bar x')\\coloneqq\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\bar x=\\bar x'","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}composition\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)(\\bar x,\\bar z)\\coloneqq\\exists\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\eta(\\bar y,\\bar z))","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}category\\text{-}projections}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{Obj}(\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle)=O\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}(A,B)=\\{f\\in M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{id}^{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}_A=e(A)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to g\\circ_{\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle}f=c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SyntacticCategory}_S(C,T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(C)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Obj}(C)=\\{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:n\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&\\quad=\\left\\{[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\,(\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(\\bar x)\\land\\psi(\\bar y))\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\,(\\varphi(\\bar x)\\to\\exists\\bar y\\,\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y))\\land T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\forall\\bar x\\forall\\bar y\\forall\\bar y'\\,((\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y)\\land\\theta(\\bar x,\\bar y'))\\to\\bar y=\\bar y')\\right\\}\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{id}^{C}_{[(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}}=[\\operatorname{Id}_{n,\\varphi}]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n,m,k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^k(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{n+m}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{m+k}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl([\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(n,\\varphi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_C([(m,\\psi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}},[(k,\\chi)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to[\\eta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\circ_C[\\theta]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}=[\\operatorname{Comp}(\\eta,\\theta)]_{\\equiv_{T,\\mathcal P}}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false}],"bytes":4835,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2501","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-syntactic-category]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","90ce6acf0c65af45","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","44e32f3fb4334e0c","e637becf421e4e61"]}